# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# The newsroom was retired when gemiso.com became a standalone English site.
# The route still exists in app/_news (a Next.js private folder, so it is not
# built) and components/news-data.ts is untouched, which means the pages can be
# restored later without losing their article IDs.
#
# Until then the old article URLs are sent to the homepage so search traffic
# does not hit a 404.
#
# Deliberately NOT redirected to gemiso.co.kr: a 301 to the Korean site tells
# search engines the two domains are the same property, which is exactly what
# separating gemiso.com was meant to avoid.
#
# If a curated English newsroom is restored later, drop the matching IDs from
# these rules first — the article IDs are unchanged.

/news       /   301
/news/      /   301
/news/*     /   301
